BeautifulRust eval fixtures

The code files under this directory (inventory.rs, config.c, config.h, test_config.c, taskgraph.py and test_taskgraph.py) are copied from BeautifulRust v1.5.0 (40db61c6fee84bd121cf288755f0e2f22a50e995), skills/rust-best-practices/evals, skills/rust-review/evals and skills/rust-port/evals: the starting files of four non-Bevy cases.
Each file is unmodified except for one added MIT line at its top.
The upstream grader files are not copied. The grader names in tests/skills_evals.rs come from BeautifulRust 40db61c6 skills/*/evals/*/graders; the text beside each name is our own.
